Design credits
--------------
SimQueue borrows design ideas from the following open-source projects.
At the time of this notice no source code from them has been copied
into this repository. If code is copied later, the specific files and
their original copyright notices will be listed here.

- XCSteward (https://github.com/acyment/XCSteward)
  Copyright 2026 XCSteward Contributors. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
  Ideas: result classes and exit-code contract, fake-tool test harness,
  atomic job claim, startup recovery, capacity-snapshot reasons,
  foreign-runner detection, infra-failure drain, timing-balanced sharding.

- manzanas (https://github.com/BariBariGood/manzanas)
  Licensed under Apache-2.0.
  Ideas: separate running/parked/boot capacity caps, load-based boot gate,
  SIGSTOP warm-pool parking, footprint watchdog, waiter expiry,
  quarantine and reset-before-grant, mock backend, simslim capability probe.

